- <a href="/scp-105">SCP-105</a> and <a href="/scp-808">SCP-808</a> are apparently being set up for a meeting already.<br />
- <a href="/scp-073">SCP-073</a> doesn't seem like too bad of a choice if it has free time. Not the most emotive, but not <em>bad</em>.<br />
- <a href="/scp-076">SCP-076</a>-2 is, well, <em>076-2</em>.<br />
- <a href="/scp-083">SCP-083</a> Would probably be a bad choice. For various reasons.</p>

